    "body": "This is potentially dangerous if the user makes poor file naming choices (e.g. if starship is installed at `/Users/<user>/Documents 2/programs/starship`, this will cause a deletion of their `~/Documents` folder).\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\nrm \"$(which starship)\"\r\n```",
